          "id": "He7x7l2dSDnNI6LT",
          "name": "Pinecone account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Chunk, embed, and index\n\nValid page text is split into approximately 1,000-character chunks with a 200-character overlap. The document loader preserves metadata, Google Gemini creates embeddings, and Pinecone stores the resulting vectors in `YOUR_PINECONE_NAMESPACE`.\n\nIngestion and retrieval must use the same embedding model. Create a standard dense Pinecone index whose dimension matches that model.",
        "height": 784,
        "width": 688,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "968dc2c5-8e78-419b-b378-5cb84ffba331",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Chunking and Indexing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        480,
        -80
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
